#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.1.0"
msgstr "버전 4.1.0"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: January 31, 2021"
msgstr "릴리즈 날짜: 2021년 1월 31일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:6
msgid "**4.1.0 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4\ 의 4.1.0 릴리즈**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:13
msgid "BREAKING"
msgstr "주요 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:15
msgid ""
"``Autoloader::loadLegacy()`` method was previously used for migration of "
"non-namespaced classes in transition to CodeIgniter v4. Since v4.1.0, "
"this support was removed."
msgstr ""
"``Autoloader::loadLegacy()`` 메서드는 이전에 CodeIgniter v4로의 전환 시 네임스페이스 없는 클래스 마이그레이션에 사용되었습니다. "
"v4.1.0부터 이 지원이 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:18
msgid "Changes"
msgstr "변경 사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:20
msgid "Dropped support for PHP 7.2"
msgstr "PHP 7.2 지원이 중단되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:23
msgid "Deprecations"
msgstr "사용 중단"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Model::fillPlaceholders()`` method, use "
"``Validation::fillPlaceholders()`` instead."
msgstr "``Model::fillPlaceholders()`` 메서드가 사용 중단되었습니다. 대신 ``Validation::fillPlaceholders()``\ 를 사용하십시오."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:28
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.0.rst:30
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG_4.1.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.1.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG_4.1.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.1.md>`_\ 을 참조하십시오."
